#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path of the directory that every account token file must be in. When empty, a token file may be anywhere the web server and poller users can read."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé ti àpò tí gbogbo fáìlì tọ́kìnì àkọọ́lẹ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ wà nínú rẹ̀. Nígbà tí ó bá ṣófo, fáìlì tọ́kìnì lè wà ní ibikíbi tí sáfà wẹ́ẹ̀bù àti àwọn olùlò poller lè kà."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Interactive Request Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìparí Ìbéèrè Alábàáṣepọ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Total time in seconds allowed for a Cloudflare API request made from the web interface, such as Verify."
msgstr "Àpapọ̀ àkókò ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí a gbà láàyè fún ìbéèrè Cloudflare API tí a ṣe láti ojú-ìwé wẹ́ẹ̀bù, bíi Ìjẹ́rìísí (Verify)."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Request Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìparí Ìbéèrè Olùkójọpọ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Total time in seconds allowed for a Cloudflare API request made by the background collector."
msgstr "Àpapọ̀ àkókò ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí a gbà láàyè fún ìbéèrè Cloudflare API tí olùkójọpọ̀ ẹ̀yìn ṣe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Level"
msgstr "Ìpele Àkọọ́lẹ̀ Ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The amount of detail the plugin writes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n àlàyé tí plugin náà ń kọ sínú àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Cacti."

#: includes/tunnel_retirement.php
msgid "The tunnel could not be retired. Check permissions and retry after collection finishes."
msgstr "A kò lè fẹ̀yìntì tunnel náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àṣẹ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́yìn tí ìkójọpọ̀ bá parí."

#: includes/tunnel_retirement.php includes/viewer.php
msgid "Retire tunnel"
msgstr "Fẹ̀yìntì tunnel"

#: includes/tunnel_retirement.php
msgid "Retiring removes the graphs and unshared data sources created for this deleted tunnel. Cacti controls RRD cleanup. The inventory record is kept."
msgstr "Fífẹ̀yìntì máa ń yọ àwọn gíráàfù àti àwọn orísun dátà tí kò ṣàjọpín tí a ṣẹ̀dá fún tunnel tí a pa rẹ́ yìí kúrò. Cacti ni ó ń ṣàkóso ìwẹ̀nùmọ́ RRD. A ó pa àkọsílẹ̀ ohun-ìní mọ́."

#: includes/viewer.php
msgid "The Cloudflare tunnels could not be read. See the Cacti log for details."
msgstr "A kò lè ka àwọn Cloudflare tunnel. Wo àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Cacti fún àlàyé kíkún."

